# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SuperLanguage — ignore rules
#
# Principle: commit the source of truth (Python data, Markdown, provenance),
# never the compiled or binary output. Every ignored artefact is reproducible
# with `python _shared/generate.py`.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Byte-compiled / cached
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# Test and type-checker caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# py_compile output and other scratch files
# *.pychk is the cfile name used by py_compile syntax checks; note that
# *.chk alone does not match *.pychk.
*.pychk
*.chk
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej


# ── Generated binaries: tracked on purpose ───────────────────────────────────
# The workbook, handbook PDF and print-ready HTML are the deliverables a
# learner downloads, so they stay in the repository rather than living only in
# a release. They are fully reproducible with:
#
#     python _shared/generate.py
#
# Nothing is ignored here on purpose.


# ── Editors and IDEs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.\#*
\#*\#


# ── Operating system ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk


# ── Not ignored, deliberately ────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# _shared/*.py                    the engine
# <Module>/_build/data/*.py       the vocabulary, as reviewable Python literals
# <Module>/_build/*.py            module config and action tree
# _shared/ipa_overrides.json      hand-checked American transcriptions
# <Module>/SuperLanguage_*_365.{xlsx,pdf,html}   the learner-facing deliverables
# <Module>/_build/html/*.html     print-ready source for the PDF
# vocabulary/MonthXX_*.md         monthly vocabulary, browsable on GitHub
# vocabulary/IPA_Provenance.json  provenance record for every American IPA
#
# The vocabulary is stored as Python rather than CSV or JSON precisely so that
# it stays reviewable in a pull request. Nothing here may be ignored.